            "description": "CSS positioning strategy.",
            "enum": [
              "absolute",
              "fixed"
            ]
          },
          "trapFocus": {
            "description": "(a11y, opt-in) When true, traps keyboard focus inside the panel while it\nis open (Tab cycles through focusable children; Shift+Tab cycles backward).\nIntended for modal overlays built on top of Popper. Non-modal usage (menus,\ntooltips) should leave this false (default) to keep the natural tab order.",
